Follow the slider API of ysfx 0.0.47

Carla bundles jpcima's ysfx; the maintained fork by Joep Vanlier raises
ysfx_max_sliders from 64 to 256 and changes three functions Carla calls:
ysfx_slider_set_value() takes a notify flag, and the slider change and
automation masks are fetched per group of 64. Pass notify = true, which is
what the old function always did, and walk the four groups when reading
the masks, so the 64-bit shift stays within one group.

Upstream: not submitted (upstream uses jpcima's ysfx)
Applies-to: all environments

